        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "International Superstar Soccer is a football video game developed by Konami for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. It is known as the best soccer game available for any 16-bit systems, mostly due to its lifelike approach, innovative for the time, that showed diversified players in the same team, with an adult look and back numbers on their respective jerseys, corresponding to real-life players of the time.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "International Superstar Soccer es un videojuego de fútbol desarrollado por Konami para la Super Nintendo Entertainment System. Es conocido como el mejor juego de fútbol disponible para sistemas de 16 bits, sobre todo por su enfoque realista, innovador para la época, que mostraba jugadores diversos dentro del mismo equipo, con aspecto adulto y dorsales en sus camisetas correspondientes a los jugadores reales de la época.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1994",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
